      "text": "js/store.js (MindMapStore)\n\n[State Variables]\n- document: MindMapDocument\n- selectedNodeID: String?\n- dragPreview: DragPreview?\n- zoomScale: Double (Clamped)\n\n[Key Operations / Engines]\n- tidyLayout() / layoutSubtree() (Dendrogram tree post-order reflow)\n- moveBranch() / finishBranchDrag()\n- addChild() / deleteBranch()\n- LocalStorage autosaves\n- Markdown and JSON parser/exporter",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": "t9xwGKlz3c7EbcsCAaVQ",
      "originalText": "js/store.js (MindMapStore)\n\n[State Variables]\n- document: MindMapDocument\n- selectedNodeID: String?\n- dragPreview: DragPreview?\n- zoomScale: Double (Clamped)\n\n[Key Operations / Engines]\n- tidyLayout() / layoutSubtree() (Dendrogram tree post-order reflow)\n- moveBranch() / finishBranchDrag()\n- addChild() / deleteBranch()\n- LocalStorage autosaves\n- Markdown and JSON parser/exporter"
    },
